### Create Alice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/create?username=Alice&balance=1000

###

### Create Bob
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/create?username=Bob&balance=500

###

### Deposit to Alice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/deposit?id=111&amount=200

###

### Transfer from Alice to Bob
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/transfer?fromId=1&toId=2&amount=150000000

###

### Get Alice Transaction History (Paginated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/transactions?page=0&size=5

###

### Get Bob Transaction History (Paginated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/6/transactions?page=0&size=5


